<div id="cookie-banner" class="cookie-banner" role="region" aria-label="Cookie notice" hidden>
  <p class="cookie-banner__text">
    We use cookies to enable authentication and save your session state. By continuing to use this site, you acknowledge our
    <button type="button" id="cookie-banner-privacy-link" class="cookie-banner__link">Privacy Notice</button>.
  </p>
  <button type="button" id="cookie-banner-ack" class="cookie-banner__ack">Acknowledge</button>
</div>

<div id="privacy-modal" class="privacy-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="privacy-modal-title" hidden>
  <div class="privacy-modal__backdrop" id="privacy-modal-backdrop"></div>
  <div class="privacy-modal__panel">
    <div class="privacy-modal__header">
      <h2 id="privacy-modal-title">Privacy Notice</h2>
      <button type="button" id="privacy-modal-close" class="privacy-modal__close" aria-label="Close privacy notice">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <div class="privacy-modal__body">
      <p>This site is built on <a href="https://github.com/lucas-iezzi/open-folio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">open-folio</a>, a self-hosted portfolio platform. To make it work, it collects and processes some information:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Session &amp; authentication:</strong> A session cookie is set to keep the site secure (e.g. CSRF protection) and, for the site owner, to stay logged into the admin panel.</li>
        <li><strong>Visit analytics:</strong> Basic visit data (page path, referrer, browser info, and a hashed IP) is recorded and stored in this site's own database, for the owner's use only. It is not shared with or sold to any third party.</li>
        <li><strong>Design sandbox (if enabled):</strong> If this site's interactive design sandbox is turned on, text you type into it is sent to the site's configured AI provider (Anthropic, OpenAI, or Google) to generate a response. That text is processed to serve the request and is not used to train public AI models.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>All data is stored on this site's own server — not a third-party platform — and is only accessible by the site owner. If you have questions or would like your data deleted, please contact the site owner directly.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
